."},{"name":"The Dockhand's Assistant","text":"HP% greatly boosts shield strength."},{"name":"Favonius Sword","text":"Generates team Energy on CRIT hits. Build some CRIT Rate."},{"name":"Sacrificial Sword","text":"ER and a situational Skill reset. Shield refresh or extra ER."},{"name":"Harbinger of Dawn","text":"Cheap CRIT option for personal damage. Off-field damage, HP above 90%."},{"name":"Skyrider Sword","text":"Accessible ER when Burst is needed. No better ER sword available."}],"a":[{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"text":"Best shields and frequent ATK buff.","stats":"HP% · HP% · HP%"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Party ATK buff after Burst.","stats":"HP%/ER · HP% · HP%"},{"names":["Tenacity of the Millelith","Vourukasha's Glow"],"text":"Easy HP-focused shield fallback.","stats":"HP% · HP% · HP%"}],"t":[{"name":"Frostbound Court","members":["Layla","Kamisato Ayaka","Mona","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Ayaka gets Cryo Resonance and a secure Freeze setup; Mona amplifies her Burst, while Kazuha groups and shreds Cryo resistance.","roles":["Shielder / Cryo Enabler","On-field DPS","Buffer / Hydro Enabler","Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Dreamguard","members":["Layla","Wanderer","Faruzan","Bennett"],"text":"Layla protects Wanderer from interruption; Faruzan and Bennett amplify his damage. Cryo absorption can grant extra CRIT Rate.","roles":["Shielder / Cryo Enabler","On-field DPS","Anemo Buffer / Debuffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Tidal Starlight","members":["Layla","Neuvillette","Fischl","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Layla shields C0 Neuvillette against interruption and enables Freeze; Fischl supplies off-field damage and Kazuha shreds Hydro RES.","roles":["Shielder / Cryo Enabler","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Battery","Buffer / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Starlit Arrows","members":["Layla","Yoimiya","Yelan","Bennett"],"text":"Layla protects Yoimiya’s attack string, while Yelan enables Vaporize and Bennett provides ATK and healing. Melt is situational.","roles":["Shielder / Cryo Enabler","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]}],"v":"Off-field Cryo: At high investment/C6, trade some HP for Cryo DMG and CRIT while keeping the shield sturdy.\nNo-Burst Shield: Skip Burst if ER is too costly; stack HP% and refresh Skill before your DPS takes the field.","n":4},"seo":{"roles":["Shielder / Support"],"about":"Layla is an HP-scaling Cryo shielder providing strong protection, off-field Cryo, and Tenacity buffs. Her shield needs no Energy, while her Burst improves Cryo application but can be skipped if ER is too costly.","pros":["Strong HP shield","Off-field Cryo","Tenacity buffs","Low field time"],"cons":["No healing","12s shield duration","Shield loss stops particles","Limited personal damage"],"weapons":["Key of Khaj-Nisut","Primordial Jade Cutter","Freedom-Sworn","The Dockhand's Assistant","Favonius Sword","Sacrificial Sword","Harbinger of Dawn","Skyrider Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":""},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith","Vourukasha's Glow"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs","role":""}],"main":["HP% / Energy Recharge","HP%","HP% / Crit Rate (Favonius)"],"stats":["HP: 35k - 45k","ER: Team dependent","CRIT: Favonius only"],"vars":[{"title":"Off-field Cryo Damage","role":"Off-field DPS","weapons":["Primordial Jade Cutter","Key of Khaj-Nisut","Harbinger of Dawn"],"arts":[{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Blizzard Strayer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Use a Cryo DMG goblet and a CRIT circlet, with enough ER to Burst and enough HP to keep the shield intact.","teams":"Best with Cryo damage buffs or Freeze support; Shenhe can boost her personal damage.","when":"For invested Layla builds, especially C6, when additional off-field Cryo damage is worth some shield strength.","cond":"C6 is preferred, not required. Blizzard Strayer is Freeze-dependent.","notes":"Tenacity usually remains better for total team support.","pre":false},{"title":"Shield Only (Low ER)","role":"Shielder","weapons":["Key of Khaj-Nisut","The Dockhand's Assistant","Favonius Sword"],"arts":[{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Tenacity of the Millelith","Vourukasha's Glow"],"pcs":"2 + 2 pcs"}],"stats":"Stack HP% on sands, goblet, and circlet; do not chase Burst ER.","teams":"Teams mainly need her shield rather than extra Cryo application from Burst.","when":"Use when she is solo Cryo, Burst costs too much ER, or her shielding is the only priority.","cond":"Without Burst, Cryo application and Shooting Star generation are reduced.","notes":"Cast Skill shortly before your on-field DPS to maximize its 12s protection.","pre":false}],"mats":["Shivada Jade Sliver","Shivada Jade Fragment","Shivada Jade Chunk","Shivada Jade Gemstone","Perpetual Caliber","Teachings of Ingenuity","Guide to Ingenuity","Philosophies of Ingenuity","Divining Scroll","Sealed Scroll","Forbidden Curse Scroll","Nilotpala Lotus","Mirror of Mushin","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 8-9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Frostbound Court","members":["Layla","Kamisato Ayaka","Mona","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Dreamguard","members":["Layla","Wanderer","Faruzan","Bennett"]},{"name":"Tidal Starlight","members":["Layla","Neuvillette","Fischl","Kaedehara Kazuha"]},{"name":"Starlit Arrows","members":["Layla","Yoimiya","Yelan","Bennett"]}]}}],"title":"Layla","el":"Cryo"}